# Email and outreach writing

When writing or editing partnership emails, parent replies, or outreach copy for Niketh:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/gradlify-email/SKILL.md` and `voice.md`.
2. No em dashes. No AI-sounding phrases (see voice.md banned list).
3. Default partner goal: book a 10-min call, not negotiate in email.
4. Show paste-ready draft; never auto-send without explicit approval.
